=== graph (exit 0) ===
stdout:
Usage: ryi graph <QUESTION> [PATH]...
Ask one question of the resolved call/type graph
e.g. ryi graph --callers src/a.ts#slug --root . src/
  --callers <[PATH#]NAME>  incoming calls
  --uses <NAME>  type uses
  --from <[PATH#]NAME>  reachable set
  --call-path <[PATH#]NAME>  shortest call paths
  --type-path <[PATH#]NAME>  shortest type paths
Input: --entry <FILE> --depth <N> --root <DIR>
Flags: --fast-receivers <written> --pattern <GLOB> --flow-path <BLOB@START:END> --slice <PATH:BYTE> --sqlite <PATH> --timeout <SECS> --at <REV> --compare <REV> --scip-index <FILE>
Switches: --reverse --slow --rust-checker --ts-checker --go-checker
stderr:
