stdout:
Usage: ryi watch [OPTIONS]
Stream fact deltas as the worktree changes
e.g. ryi watch --root . --once
Input: --root <DIR>
Flags: --pattern <GLOB> --kinds <KINDS> --receipts <PATH> --poll-ms <POLL_MS>
Switches: --once
